  "description": "Gu Yongtaek has been a member of a criminal organization since he was young.\n\nShortly after transferring to a new organization, he receives an assignment: \"Protect a woman named Joo Yoon and make sure she breaks up with her boyfriend.\"\n\nHowever, just one week after Yongtaek is dispatched as her bodyguard, Joo Yoon breaks up with her boyfriend, bringing his mission to an abrupt end.\n\nWhile comforting the heartbroken Joo Yoon, Yongtaek unexpectedly finds himself agreeing to become her sex partner.\n\nAs they spend more time together, the two gradually fall for each other.\n\nGu Yongtaek! Love or loyalty to the organization? That is the question.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lovereport)",
